SNAKES & LADDERS (CHSnakes)
Copyright 2026 bateske

From CHBoardwalk (https://github.com/bateske/CHBoardwalk), CHChess
(https://github.com/bateske/CHChess) and CHBlackjack
(https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack), all Apache-2.0: the input and
frame pacing (now in the CHGame library,
platform/board/arduino/CHGame/libraries/CHGame/src/chgame/Input.*), palette, drawing, outlined
lettering, effects, sound sequencer, flash saving, debug protocol, the
game/stage event flow, the fruit tokens, the die, the pointing glove and the
PC simulator and tools, adapted here. The top-down zooming view follows
CHBackgammon's (https://github.com/bateske/CHBackgammon, Apache-2.0).
CHBlackjack is a derivative of "Blackjack" for the Arduboy by Press Play On
Tape (Apache-2.0); the 3x5 pixel font in the CHGame library
(platform/board/arduino/CHGame/libraries/CHGame/src/chgame/Draw.cpp) is Press Play On Tape's.

Everything else - the board, the ladders and snakes and how they are drawn,
the rules of both games, the CPU players and the presentation - is new,
under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).
